-- Ruins of Gilneas (Silverpine/Hillsbrad side of the Forsaken and Worgen war): quest NPCs and objects of the Cataclysm
-- chains that had no spawn. Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8; the positions match the spawn maps on Wowhead MoP Classic.
--
-- Deathstalker Commander Belmont, Forward Commander Onslaught (27333 to 27423), Captain Rutsak ("Vengeance for Our
-- Soldiers") and Lord Godfrey, the Worgen Rebels and 7th Legion Submariners (53 of 73 sniffed copies, Wowhead shows 53)
-- they send you against, and the objects of "Forsaken Communication Device" (27345) and "Wolfsbane" (27342; 29 of the 49
-- on Wowhead) were not spawned. Their loot tables already existed.

DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9310403 AND 9310510;

DELETE FROM `gameobject` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 1068238 AND 1068267;

UPDATE `creature_template` SET `faction_A`=68, `faction_H`=68 WHERE `entry`=45389;
UPDATE `creature_template` SET `faction_A`=123, `faction_H`=123 WHERE `entry`=45403;
